node_modules

# Secrets and runtime state. These are per-installation data, generated in
# HERMES_DATA_DIR at runtime — a copy baked into the image would ship the
# building machine's credentials and mail to every container that runs it.
# The patterns are unanchored so they match at any depth: the AES key lives at
# services/secret.key when HERMES_DATA_DIR is unset, not at the root.
.env
.env.*
**/*.key
**/accounts.json
**/email-cache.json
**/categories.json
**/search-index.json
**/*.tmp

test
*.log
npm-debug.log*
